      "lyrics": "Come sit close, the candles glow / Friends and family, row by row / Bread is warm and hearts are wide / No one waiting left outside / Yachad, yachad, we sing as one / Shalom from dusk to rising sun / Lai lai lai, lai lai lai lai",
